<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">Dear Client Contact,</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">Welcome to Insperity from the Reporting &amp; Compliance Group of
Insperity's Health and Welfare Services department. Our group assists Insperity
clients with compliance in regards to the Play or Pay provisions of the
Affordable Care Act (ACA). &nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;">The attached document <b>ACA (Play or Pay) for Insperity Clients </b>will
help explain these provisions and how Insperity complies with them in regards
to Insperity-sponsored benefit plans. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 13pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 13pt;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt">ACA Information Verification: <span style="color:red">Action
Required <o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 13pt;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;">As part of our efforts to assist you, our Reporting &amp; Compliance
Group would like to confirm certain employer information for your company, and
request additional information as well. &nbsp;Please reply to this email to
provide confirmation, additional information, or make corrections to the
information below to ensure ACA employer and employee calculations are
accurate. <span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 13pt;"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;">For a brief description of the below terminology please see the
attached document <b>ACA Definitions Quick Reference Guide for Insperity
Clients </b>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: var(--lwc-fontWeightBold,700); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font style="" color="#ff0000" size="5">"&lt;Insert ALE table here.&gt;"</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0.5in; line-height: 13pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt">Predecessor Hours
Request: <span style="color:red">Action Required <o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;color:red"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0.5in;">Insperity records show that you
have one or more part-time or seasonal employee(s). For Insperity to accurately
calculate your company's next ALE determination (in Jan. 2023) and perform
accurate initial and/or standard measurement period calculations for your
non-full-time employees, we need predecessor hours for the employees identified
in the attached spreadsheet. This spreadsheet shows the date range for the
hours that are needed and columns to either record monthly hours or a column to
record total hours for the date range requested. &nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0.5in;">If we do not receive predecessor
hours from you for these employees, Insperity will use a selected default
calculation value of four hours per day for any part-time employees (4 hours
per day, 5 days a week), and eight hours per day for any full-time or seasonal
employees (8 hours per day, 5 days a week) for all your employee measurement
calculations. &nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Thank you for your prompt attention to this time sensitive
matter. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact
us at <a href="mailto:ale@insperity.com"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">ale@insperity.com </span></a><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Kind
regards, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&lt;insert signature&gt;</span></p>]]></td>
